This part results in three files:
- class1_sequences.fasta: contains the sequences of the hits that are classified as class 1
- class2_sequences.fasta: contains the sequences of the hits that are classified as class 2
- proteomes_filtered.tsv == proteomes_metadata.tsv with the viral proteomes removed

And in two tables:
- table1_class1.csv: contains the statistics of the hits that are classified as class 1
- table1_class2.csv: contains the statistics of the hits that are classified as class 2

Running process:

filter_viral.py          → data/processed/proteomes_filtered.tsv
                                    ↓
mmseq_run.sh             → data/raw/m8s/*.m8
                                    ↓
filter_hits.py           → data/processed/filtered_hits.json
                                    ↓
extract_sequences.py     → data/processed/class1_sequences.fasta
                           data/processed/class2_sequences.fasta
                                    ↓
generate_tables.py       → results/stats/table1_class1.csv
                           results/stats/table1_class2.csv